reagent-name-moff-burzium = Burzium
reagent-desc-moff-burzium = A concoction that clumps together. While mildly poisonous to most species, it slowly builds up and harms a slime's system. Whenever enough of it has accumulated in the metabolizer's system, it bursts from them causing major damage.

reagent-name-moff-spinnerine = Spinnerine
reagent-desc-moff-spinnerine = A pathogen known for starving spiders to death. While less effective on other species, it causes Arachnids to produce silk at an unhealthy rate, starving them in the process.

reagent-name-moff-avalitoxin = Avali Toxin
reagent-desc-moff-avalitoxin = A metallic slurry that corrodes augmentations typically used by Avali.